  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>AquilaTrader</h1>
    <p class="muted">Webroot OK. Cette page sert juste à confirmer la route Nginx.</p>

    <div class="card">
      <div>Endpoints utiles :</div>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/wolverine/traderone/api/health">/wolverine/traderone/api/health</a></li>
        <li><a href="/wolverine/traderone/vault/health">/wolverine/traderone/vault/health</a></li>
        <li><a href="/wolverine/vault-api/health">/wolverine/vault-api/health</a></li>
